                    Adviser on Political Relations (Murray), and the Acting Secretary of State
                    (Stettinius).</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d415-f2" n="35" xml:id="d415-f2-content">
                <p>The United States Army’s School of Military Government.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
